<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/submits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an agent and an entity that is submitted to some third party, for example a grant application submitted to a funding agency, a manuscript submitted to a publisher, a quotation submitted by a vendor, or a dataset submitted by a researcher to a data repository."@en .
